# Laravel Stack

This portal uses **Laravel + Blade + Bootstrap 5 + plain CSS + plain JS + MySQL**. Stick to that.

## Allowed

- Blade views, Bootstrap 5 (CDN or local), small custom CSS, plain JavaScript
- Thin controllers; one method ≈ one action (Auth, Donation, Claim, Notification, Admin, Volunteer)
- Forms with Blade + `@csrf`; simple validation in the controller or a Form Request

## Do Not Add (unless the user asks)

- React, Vue, Tailwind, Livewire, Inertia, Alpine, or other SPA patterns
- Extra packages “for later” that the design doc does not need

```php
// ❌ BAD — SPA / extra framework for a form
return Inertia::render('Donation/Create');

// ✅ GOOD — normal Blade form page
return view('donor.donations.create');
```

```blade
{{-- ❌ BAD --}}
<form method="POST" action="/donations">

{{-- ✅ GOOD --}}
<form method="POST" action="{{ route('donations.store') }}">
    @csrf
    {{-- fields --}}
</form>
```
